36
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:20,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Lucida Fax"><font size="18"><font color="#ffffff"><b>what were you gazing at?</b></font></font></font></font>

37
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:45,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Akamaru!</font>

38
00:01:52,090 --> 00:01:53,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait up, Akamaru.</font>

39
00:01:57,590 --> 00:01:58,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru!</font>

40
00:02:01,140 --> 00:02:02,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

41
00:02:03,930 --> 00:02:08,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I made you a box lunch.
Eat it if you like.</font>

42
00:02:09,100 --> 00:02:10,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, thanks.</font>

43
00:02:17,610 --> 00:02:19,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this?</font>

44
00:02:20,410 --> 00:02:24,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the heck's the idea, you guys...?
This isn't a picnic.</font>

45
00:02:25,450 --> 00:02:26,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry.</font>

46
00:02:26,700 --> 00:02:28,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on, it's okay.</font>

47
00:02:28,620 --> 00:02:31,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's an easy mission
the three of us can manage.</font>

48
00:02:32,090 --> 00:02:34,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You said yourself
you weren't fired up, right?</font>

49
00:02:36,670 --> 00:02:38,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}MISSION CHECK IN</b></font>

50
00:02:38,970 --> 00:02:40,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not fired up!</font>

51
00:02:41,430 --> 00:02:43,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a mission to catch a petty thief.</font>

52
00:02:44,140 --> 00:02:46,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'd be the same no matter
who went on the mission.</font>

53
00:02:47,060 --> 00:02:49,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look. Under normal circumstances,</font>

54
00:02:49,060 --> 00:02:52,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a three-man team of Kiba, Hinata
and Shino would be fundamental.</font>

55
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:54,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But unfortunately, Shino is absent
as he's off on a different mission.</font>

56
00:02:55,980 --> 00:02:58,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'd be better if even you were there
than not, right?</font>

57
00:02:58,490 --> 00:03:01,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What, Old Lady?!
That's taking it too far!</font>

58
00:03:03,950 --> 00:03:04,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll do my best.</font>

59
00:03:05,370 --> 00:03:07,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a mission I kind of
can't get into, though.</font>

60
00:03:09,370 --> 00:03:12,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's probably no need to take
the trouble to determine a troop leader.</font>

61
00:03:12,790 --> 00:03:18,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyway, your mission is
to capture the man who stole</font>

62
00:03:18,550 --> 00:03:21,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Misogi tea jar owned by
the feudal lord of the Land of Tea.</font>

63
00:03:21,220 --> 00:03:22,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This man, Gosunkugi.</font>

64
00:03:24,180 --> 00:03:28,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">According to sources,
he's now hiding in the Land of Stone.</font>

65
00:03:29,390 --> 00:03:32,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get over there lickety-split
and catch him lickety-split.</font>

66
00:03:33,020 --> 00:03:37,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hearing that makes me feel
less fired up than ever.</font>

67
00:03:40,820 --> 00:03:42,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here, Akamaru.</font>

68
00:03:45,700 --> 00:03:48,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, missions like this are okay
once in a while, right?</font>

69
00:03:48,540 --> 00:03:49,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's take it easy.</font>

70
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:53,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's an easy mission, so all the more
reason I want to finish it up quick.</font>

71
00:03:53,540 --> 00:03:56,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What'll happen if the Pervy Sage
comes back while I'm gone?</font>

72
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:58,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry, Naruto.</font>

73
00:03:58,630 --> 00:04:04,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... I was so happy to be
on a mission... with you.</font>

74
00:04:05,930 --> 00:04:08,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? What did you say, Hinata?
I can't hear you.</font>

75
00:04:10,100 --> 00:04:13,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you blushing for?
You're a weird one.</font>

76
00:04:13,190 --> 00:04:15,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, hold your horses... Look.</font>

77
00:04:16,980 --> 00:04:19,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll be in the Land of Stone
once we cross that mountain pass.</font>

78
00:04:20,440 --> 00:04:22,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be sure to fortify yourself
with food by then.</font>

79
00:04:27,780 --> 00:04:31,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's kind of complicated
when it's like eating myself.</font>

80
00:04:32,620 --> 00:04:34,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, this is good!</font>

81
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:37,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata, you'd make a great wife!</font>

82
00:04:38,130 --> 00:04:39,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

83
00:04:41,130 --> 00:04:42,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wife...?</font>

84
00:05:09,780 --> 00:05:12,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the first post station
of the Land of Stone.</font>

85
00:05:12,660 --> 00:05:15,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Doesn't it look... kind of rough?</font>

86
00:05:25,400 --> 00:05:29,410
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"><font color="#cdcdcc">Friend or Foe!</font></font>

87
00:05:25,400 --> 00:05:29,410
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"><font color="#cdcdcc">Bounty Hunter of the Wild</font></font>

88
00:05:52,700 --> 00:05:56,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are these guys doing...
staring like that?</font>

89
00:05:59,670 --> 00:06:02,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This doesn't feel like
we'll be able to do this lickety-split.</font>

90
00:06:06,340 --> 00:06:07,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it, Akamaru?</font>

91
00:06:14,100 --> 00:06:18,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be that Gosunkugi guy
is among them?</font>

92
00:06:22,860 --> 00:06:24,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got you, Gosunkugi!</font>

93
00:06:26,320 --> 00:06:33,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"WANTED"</b></font>

94
00:06:29,450 --> 00:06:30,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a photo.</font>

95
00:06:30,700 --> 00:06:33,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What, this is Gosunkugi, isn't it?</font>

96
00:06:34,830 --> 00:06:38,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}{"REWARD THREE MILLION RYO"</b></font>

97
00:06:36,580 --> 00:06:38,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Three million ryo?</font>

98
00:06:38,830 --> 00:06:40,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the meaning of this?</font>

99
00:06:40,250 --> 00:06:43,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look... They're hanging over there,
and here, too.</font>

100
00:06:49,010 --> 00:06:51,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, I'll try asking someone.</font>

101
00:06:55,220 --> 00:06:56,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hello!</font>

102
00:07:01,900 --> 00:07:02,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can I help you?</font>

103
00:07:03,190 --> 00:07:05,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have something I'd like to ask you.</font>

104
00:07:06,030 --> 00:07:09,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What, if you're not a customer, beat it.</font>

105
00:07:09,320 --> 00:07:12,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I'll order something...
I'll have ramen.</font>

106
00:07:12,450 --> 00:07:15,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll have a hamburger steak with cheese.
He'll have milk.</font>

107
00:07:19,290 --> 00:07:22,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is funny. Milk?
Hamburger steak with cheese?</font>

108
00:07:22,630 --> 00:07:24,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And ramen on top of that?</font>

109
00:07:28,670 --> 00:07:31,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you making a fool of me?
Get out, brats!</font>

110
00:07:31,760 --> 00:07:33,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it's the money, we have some.</font>

111
00:07:33,840 --> 00:07:35,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not the issue.</font>

112
00:07:36,010 --> 00:07:39,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh... It's dangerous for kids
to carry such a large amount of money...</font>

113
00:07:39,730 --> 00:07:41,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll take charge of it for you.</font>

114
00:07:41,850 --> 00:07:44,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After all, there are lots of bad men
in this town.</font>

115
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:48,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, what are you doing?
Are you still in?</font>

116
00:07:48,320 --> 00:07:51,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, just a minute.
I got the money. I'll be right over.</font>

117
00:07:53,280 --> 00:07:55,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's with you? Hey, let go!</font>

118
00:07:55,620 --> 00:07:58,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're the one who'll let go.</font>

119
00:08:02,830 --> 00:08:03,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How about that?</font>

120
00:08:04,630 --> 00:08:06,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You brat... You want to fight?!</font>

121
00:08:07,090 --> 00:08:09,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the plan... Bring it!</font>

122
00:08:10,510 --> 00:08:11,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You punk!</font>

123
00:08:11,880 --> 00:08:13,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold it, Naruto.</font>

124
00:08:13,340 --> 00:08:14,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, look around.</font>

125
00:08:22,310 --> 00:08:23,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is bad.</font>

126
00:08:24,230 --> 00:08:26,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Master, milk.</font>

127
00:08:26,690 --> 00:08:27,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who the hell are you?</font>

128
00:08:30,440 --> 00:08:32,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, coming right up!</font>

129
00:08:34,950 --> 00:08:35,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here you are.</font>

130
00:08:36,160 --> 00:08:36,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks.</font>

131
00:08:38,410 --> 00:08:41,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, no need to hesitate.
Drink up.</font>

132
00:08:41,330 --> 00:08:44,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a treat from
old billiard-ball head over there.</font>

133
00:08:46,920 --> 00:08:50,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Billiard-ball head" means me?
Knock it off, you jerk!</font>

134
00:08:51,210 --> 00:08:53,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who would treat some puppy milk?</font>

135
00:08:53,630 --> 00:08:55,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You want to get killed?!</font>

136
00:09:09,150 --> 00:09:11,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bounty, Michizo Manaka.</font>

137
00:09:12,900 --> 00:09:14,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can take the credit, Master.</font>

138
00:09:16,110 --> 00:09:18,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take the money for the milk
from his bounty...</font>

139
00:09:19,280 --> 00:09:23,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the money to repair the table, too.
I don't need change.</font>

140
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:26,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's strong.</font>

141
00:09:27,920 --> 00:09:31,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you in the same trade as I am?
Sorry about that.</font>

142
00:09:37,590 --> 00:09:38,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

143
00:09:41,060 --> 00:09:42,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something you want?</font>

144
00:09:42,520 --> 00:09:44,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who the heck are you, old man?</font>

145
00:09:45,390 --> 00:09:46,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Old man" you say?</font>

146
00:09:48,060 --> 00:09:51,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm Sazanami, a bounty hunter.</font>

147
00:09:53,570 --> 00:09:55,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How cool!</font>

148
00:09:56,570 --> 00:09:57,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Old man!</font>

149
00:09:59,070 --> 00:10:02,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say, say...
That thing earlier was cool.</font>

150
00:10:03,120 --> 00:10:04,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The iai-nuki?</font>

151
00:10:04,580 --> 00:10:08,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was so fast I couldn't see when
you drew your sword.</font>

152
00:10:09,080 --> 00:10:10,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was really surprising.</font>

153
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:15,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I bet that's what they mean
when they say "In a blink of an eye."</font>

154
00:10:16,260 --> 00:10:19,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Life and death is on the line
for us bounty hunters...</font>

155
00:10:19,890 --> 00:10:21,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter how many lives we can have,
it wouldn't be enough</font>

156
00:10:21,970 --> 00:10:24,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if we couldn't draw our sword
faster than others.</font>

157
00:10:25,040 --> 00:10:27,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say, say! Say, say!
What's a bounty hunter?</font>

158
00:10:28,350 --> 00:10:29,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's see...</font>

159
00:10:30,480 --> 00:10:34,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are people who offer a bounty
in order to capture bad guys.</font>

160
00:10:35,820 --> 00:10:40,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And a bounty hunter catches
those bad guys and receives the bounty.</font>

161
00:10:43,160 --> 00:10:48,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then this guy has
a bounty on him, right?</font>

162
00:10:49,460 --> 00:10:50,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boy, that's...</font>

163
00:10:51,420 --> 00:10:54,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why's there so much money on his head?</font>

164
00:10:54,090 --> 00:10:56,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This guy's just a simple thief...</font>

165
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:58,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A simple thief, you say?</font>

166
00:10:58,760 --> 00:11:01,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boy, this guy's a super A-rank bounty</font>

167
00:11:02,010 --> 00:11:05,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who has killed dozens of people
for the sake of stealing.</font>

168
00:11:05,850 --> 00:11:06,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

169
00:11:06,850 --> 00:11:07,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way.</font>

170
00:11:08,140 --> 00:11:09,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say what?</font>

171
00:11:10,230 --> 00:11:13,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the meaning of this?
I haven't heard about that.</font>

172
00:11:13,480 --> 00:11:15,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The feudal lord who commissioned
this mission</font>

173
00:11:15,770 --> 00:11:17,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">might not have known about that.</font>

174
00:11:18,900 --> 00:11:19,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mission?</font>

175
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:22,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah. We're Hidden Leaf Ninja</font>

176
00:11:22,620 --> 00:11:26,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and we came to this town
to capture Gosunkugi.</font>

177
00:11:27,080 --> 00:11:28,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leaf?</font>

178
00:11:30,750 --> 00:11:33,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you're ninja, huh?</font>

179
00:11:35,710 --> 00:11:36,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is interesting.</font>

180
00:11:37,380 --> 00:11:40,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So even kids like this
are qualified to be ninja?</font>

181
00:11:40,670 --> 00:11:43,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! Don't make fun of us!</font>

182
00:11:43,680 --> 00:11:46,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, don't get so mad.
Sorry about that...</font>

183
00:11:46,640 --> 00:11:49,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll treat you guys to something. Milk?</font>

184
00:11:50,020 --> 00:11:53,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're not Akamaru. I want ramen!</font>

185
00:11:53,690 --> 00:11:55,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I'll have a hamburger steak
with cheese.</font>

186
00:11:56,230 --> 00:11:59,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess I'll have ramen, too.</font>

187
00:12:00,030 --> 00:12:01,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay. Come with me.</font>

188
00:12:03,660 --> 00:12:07,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez, no way would there be
ramen in a bar.</font>

189
00:12:08,160 --> 00:12:10,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, old man. Would even miso ramen
topped with pork be okay?</font>

190
00:12:10,830 --> 00:12:13,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure, have anything you like.</font>

191
00:12:24,720 --> 00:12:28,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is this? We're rapidly moving away
from town.</font>

192
00:12:29,520 --> 00:12:31,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't see a ramen shop anywhere.</font>

193
00:12:36,810 --> 00:12:37,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then...</font>

194
00:12:46,660 --> 00:12:48,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't see any ramen shops.</font>

195
00:12:49,450 --> 00:12:51,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what I said earlier about treating
you guys is cancelled.</font>

196
00:12:52,960 --> 00:12:56,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry, but you guys are going to die here.</font>

197
00:12:57,080 --> 00:12:58,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Old man...</font>

198
00:13:11,100 --> 00:13:14,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys are going to die here.</font>

199
00:13:15,270 --> 00:13:18,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, old man... What's the idea?</font>

200
00:13:18,400 --> 00:13:22,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think you guys would know
that Gosunkugi is in this town.</font>

201
00:13:23,400 --> 00:13:25,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what if we do know?</font>

202
00:13:26,570 --> 00:13:31,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gosunkugi is my prey.
I can't hand him over to you.</font>

203
00:13:32,370 --> 00:13:36,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Knock it off!
You should just go get him yourself.</font>

204
00:13:36,460 --> 00:13:39,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, even if you guys are kids,</font>

205
00:13:39,590 --> 00:13:42,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's a different story when it comes
to Leaf Ninja.</font>

206
00:13:43,170 --> 00:13:48,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's better to have fewer...
Wait, no competitors.</font>

207
00:13:48,930 --> 00:13:49,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Old man.</font>

208
00:13:52,100 --> 00:13:52,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I go.</font>

209
00:14:00,400 --> 00:14:01,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata!</font>

210
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:02,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's dirty!</font>

211
00:14:03,400 --> 00:14:04,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

212
00:14:04,740 --> 00:14:07,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art of Beast Mimicry:
All-Four Jutsu!</font>

213
00:14:08,910 --> 00:14:09,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Interesting.</font>

214
00:14:11,580 --> 00:14:12,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bring it.</font>

215
00:14:12,370 --> 00:14:14,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't lose at speed!</font>

216
00:14:23,170 --> 00:14:24,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! Where are you?</font>

217
00:14:24,800 --> 00:14:25,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Too slow.</font>

218
00:14:33,600 --> 00:14:34,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boy...</font>

219
00:14:35,350 --> 00:14:37,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now you're the last one.</font>

220
00:14:39,270 --> 00:14:40,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

221
00:14:45,730 --> 00:14:46,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...</font>

222
00:14:48,030 --> 00:14:49,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you do as you please!</font>

223
00:15:02,250 --> 00:15:03,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Over here!</font>

224
00:15:11,090 --> 00:15:12,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're mine.</font>

225
00:15:18,890 --> 00:15:20,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Almost.</font>

226
00:15:21,730 --> 00:15:22,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Forgive me, boy.</font>

227
00:15:24,150 --> 00:15:27,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be the one to defeat him,
no matter what.</font>

228
00:15:58,770 --> 00:15:59,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru.</font>

229
00:16:00,890 --> 00:16:04,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! He got us good.</font>

230
00:16:05,110 --> 00:16:06,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata, you okay?</font>

231
00:16:07,520 --> 00:16:08,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

232
00:16:10,070 --> 00:16:10,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where's Sazanami?</font>

233
00:16:12,910 --> 00:16:15,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be he went after Gosunkugi?</font>

234
00:16:15,160 --> 00:16:18,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't just sit here like this!
He'll beat us to the draw.</font>

235
00:16:25,670 --> 00:16:28,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! Where is that old man?</font>

236
00:16:33,050 --> 00:16:35,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did he leave town?</font>

237
00:16:36,640 --> 00:16:38,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Going after Gosunkugi?</font>

238
00:16:41,230 --> 00:16:42,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru, we're counting on you!</font>

239
00:17:14,130 --> 00:17:16,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The most crucial treasure is missing here.</font>

240
00:17:16,970 --> 00:17:19,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Filthy hyena.</font>

241
00:17:25,690 --> 00:17:28,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I waited a long time
for you to make your move.</font>

242
00:17:29,560 --> 00:17:33,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Unfortunately, I have
an important job to do.</font>

243
00:17:34,570 --> 00:17:38,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Time is valuable.
I'll get right to taking care of you.</font>

244
00:17:51,420 --> 00:17:54,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Torpedo Nail.</font>

245
00:17:54,380 --> 00:17:56,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gosunkugi, here I come!</font>

246
00:18:01,350 --> 00:18:03,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't move anymore.</font>

247
00:18:19,490 --> 00:18:20,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's over.</font>

248
00:18:21,450 --> 00:18:22,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Finish him.</font>

249
00:18:24,870 --> 00:18:26,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

250
00:18:27,500 --> 00:18:29,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gosunkugi, you're under arrest!</font>

251
00:18:34,880 --> 00:18:36,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it. Reinforcements, huh?</font>

252
00:18:36,920 --> 00:18:37,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Retreat!</font>

253
00:18:39,720 --> 00:18:40,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you get away!</font>

254
00:18:41,600 --> 00:18:42,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait.</font>

255
00:18:45,970 --> 00:18:47,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Boy...</font>

256
00:18:47,980 --> 00:18:49,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You must not go.</font>

257
00:18:54,780 --> 00:18:55,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Old man!</font>

258
00:18:55,980 --> 00:18:58,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Old Man Sazanami.</font>

259
00:19:00,200 --> 00:19:05,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stay away from him.
He's too much for you guys.</font>

260
00:19:22,180 --> 00:19:24,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How could such a strong guy be beaten?</font>

261
00:19:25,600 --> 00:19:28,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gosunkugi isn't a mere thief.</font>

262
00:19:29,810 --> 00:19:32,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's a Shinobi, same as us.</font>

263
00:19:33,150 --> 00:19:34,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shinobi.</font>

264
00:19:45,660 --> 00:19:46,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sazanami!</font>

265
00:19:58,340 --> 00:20:00,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is this one of Gosunkugi's comrades?</font>

266
00:20:04,470 --> 00:20:08,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You! As I recall,
you were in the bar before...</font>

267
00:20:08,680 --> 00:20:09,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

268
00:20:13,940 --> 00:20:16,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who was that guy?</font>

269
00:20:17,270 --> 00:20:18,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

270
00:20:21,700 --> 00:20:22,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A wanted flyer.</font>

271
00:20:23,570 --> 00:20:26,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did he mistake us for Gosunkugi?</font>

272
00:20:27,200 --> 00:20:29,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, that's not it.</font>

273
00:20:30,580 --> 00:20:33,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"This man who calls himself Tokichi
is a major criminal</font>

274
00:20:33,580 --> 00:20:36,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who has killed a family of three..."</font>

275
00:20:38,000 --> 00:20:40,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"He has a bird-shaped birthmark
on his chest."</font>

276
00:20:40,550 --> 00:20:43,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A bird-shaped birthmark...?
It couldn't be...</font>

277
00:20:44,260 --> 00:20:45,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it, Hinata?</font>

278
00:20:46,090 --> 00:20:48,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't tell because
his face is covered with scars...</font>

279
00:20:49,640 --> 00:20:52,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But he has... a bird-shaped birthmark.</font>

280
00:20:55,980 --> 00:20:58,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He has a bounty on his head, too?</font>

281
00:20:58,770 --> 00:21:02,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the heck is going on
with everything?</font>

282
00:21:19,380 --> 00:21:31,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>dokomademo tsudzuku michi ni wa ironna koto arunda ne</b></font></font></font></font>

283
00:21:19,380 --> 00:21:31,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>so many things happen on this endless road, right?</b></font></font></font></font>

284
00:21:31,030 --> 00:21:42,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>tsuyogari na kimi ga kyou wa juwaki koshi ni namida koe</b></font></font></font></font>

285
00:21:31,030 --> 00:21:42,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>although you're strong-willed your voice wavered on the phone today</b></font></font></font></font>

286
00:21:42,630 --> 00:21:53,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>donna yume oikakete kokomade kitan darou</b></font></font></font></font>

287
00:21:42,630 --> 00:21:53,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>what dreams did you chase to get here?</b></font></font></font></font>

288
00:21:53,420 --> 00:22:05,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>wakara na kunattari suru koto wa boku ni datte aru kara nee BABY</b></font></font></font></font>

289
00:21:53,420 --> 00:22:05,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>even I have times when I just don't understand baby</b></font></font></font></font>

290
00:22:05,760 --> 00:22:17,280
